restart-required-title = Restart Required

restart-required-heading2 = Sorry, { -brand-short-name } needs a quick restart
restart-required-intro2 = { -brand-short-name } needs to finish an update. Restart to keep things secure and smooth.
window-restoration-info2 = We’ll reopen all windows and tabs except private ones.
restart-required-why-now-question = Why now?
restart-required-why-now-answer = This can happen when another { -brand-short-name } profile or instance updates, or when an update can’t wait until your next restart.

restart-required-more-details-heading = More details

restart-required-multiple-instances-question = Why can this happen with multiple profiles or { -brand-short-name } instances?
restart-required-multiple-instances-answer = If one profile or instance updates while another is still open, the open one can be left on an older version. Restarting keeps everything on the same version.

restart-required-single-instance-question = I don’t use multiple profiles or instances. Why is this happening?
restart-required-single-instance-answer = { -brand-short-name } may need a restart if an update is applied in the background while it’s open.
restart-required-single-instance-answer-2 = This can happen during a long browsing session, or when your operating system updates { -brand-short-name }. Restarting keeps { -brand-short-name } secure and working normally.

restart-required-unsaved-work-question = Could I lose unsaved work?
restart-required-unsaved-work-answer = Possibly, and we know that’s frustrating. { -brand-short-name } will reopen your tabs, but unsaved work inside webpages, like text in a form, may not be restored. Private Windows won’t reopen to protect your privacy.

restart-required-fix-question = This is really annoying! Is { -brand-short-name } working on a fix?
# Note: normally we would link to the bug here, but if the user sees this message,
# then they cannot visit a link without a restart.
restart-required-fix-answer = Yes. We know this is disruptive, and we’re working on a fix to prevent it. Follow our progress in Bugzilla bug 2072739.

restart-button-label2 = Restart
# Expands the "More details" section below the buttons.
restart-required-see-more-button = See more
# Collapses the "More details" section below the buttons.
restart-required-see-less-button = See less
